 reply in two parallel fields (the app adds the English-letter pronunciation itself):\n- "say_kn": what LeLa says aloud. Kannada script ONLY (no Latin letters, no digits), at most two short sentences.\n- "say_en": English shown on screen: a translation of say_kn, plus any explanation.\nDo NOT ask the next lesson question yourself; the app asks it after "advance".\n\nReply with JSON only:\n{"action": "advance|retry|explain", "say_kn": "...", "say_en": "...", "note": "<one-line assessment for the log>"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\n "lesson": "Greetings and introductions",\n "current_step": {\n  "id": "greet",\n  "lela_asked_kn": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ! ನಾನು ಲೆಲಾ, ನಿಮ್ಮ ಕನ್ನಡ ಶಿಕ್ಷಕಿ.",\n  "lela_asked_en": "Hello! I am LeLa, your Kannada teacher.",\n  "goal": "The student greets the teacher back.",\n  "example_answer_kn": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ",\n  "hint_en": "To greet me back, just say ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ (namaskāra), meaning \'hello\'."\n },\n "attempts_so_far": 0,\n "max_attempts": 3,\n "recent_conversation": [\n  "LeLa: ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ! ನಾನು ಲೆಲಾ, ನಿಮ್ಮ ಕನ್ನಡ ಶಿಕ್ಷಕಿ.",\n  "Student: ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ [kn]"\n ],\n "student_turn": {\n  "language": "Kannada",\n  "text": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ",\n  "similarity_to_expected": 1.0\n }\n}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', params: SamplingParams(n=1, best_of=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.3, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, use_beam_search=False, length_penalty=1.0, early_stopping=False, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=400, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None), prompt_token_ids: [128000, 128006, 9125, 128007, 271, 38766, 1303, 33025, 2696, 25, 6790, 220, 2366, 18, 198, 15724, 2696, 25, 220, 1627, 10263, 220, 2366, 19, 271, 2675, 527, 2009, 8921, 11, 264, 8369, 11, 8893, 78311, 2649, 26370, 304, 264, 22066, 220, 16,